The Chapman-Shaoxing ECG corpus this task consumes is distributed separately by
PhysioNet under CC BY 4.0 and is NOT included in this repository. See
tasks/medical-ai/ecg-arrhythmia/lightweight-explainable-lora-vit/environment/data/README.md.

The SNOMED CT code/abbreviation table in environment/data/snomed_conditions.csv is
transcribed from the PhysioNet/CinC Challenge 2021 diagnosis mapping tables.
